44">2 TRI</text><path class="w" d="M160,240 V262 M148,262 H172"/><path class="w" d="M148,274 Q160,284 172,274"/><path class="w" d="M160,279 V330"/><path class="w" d="M136,252 v8 M132,256 h8"/><text class="lbl" x="182" y="272">C1 10µ</text><path class="w" d="M450,170 H500"/><text class="pin" x="444" y="174" text-anchor="end">3 OUT</text><path class="w" d="M500,170 V190"/><rect class="w" x="492" y="190" width="16" height="28"/><text class="lbl" x="516" y="208">R3 330Ω</text><path class="w" d="M500,218 V238"/><path class="f" d="M492,238 L508,238 L500,254 Z"/><path class="w" d="M492,254 H508 M500,254 V330"/><path class="w" d="M512,240 L522,246 M512,248 L522,254"/><circle class="con" cx="556" cy="222" r="11"/><text class="cot" x="556" y="227" text-anchor="middle">4</text><text class="lbl" x="486" y="250" text-anchor="end">LED</text><path class="w" d="M450,260 H480 M480,260 V282 M472,282 H488 M472,290 H488 M480,290 V330"/><text class="pin" x="444" y="264" text-anchor="end">5 CTRL</text><text class="lbl" x="506" y="296">C2 10n</text><text class="lbl" x="320" y="372" text-anchor="middle">f = 1,44 / ((R1 + 2·R2) · C1) ≈ 0,7 Hz → LED blinkt etwa alle 1,5 Sekunden</text></svg>
